data_use (ethyca 3.1.4)
`-- analytics  Analytics  — Provides analytics for activities such as system and advertising performance reporting, insights and fraud detection.
    `-- reporting  Analytics for Reporting  — Provides analytics for general reporting such as system and advertising performance.
        |-- ad_performance  Analytics for Advertising Performance  — Provides analytics for reporting of advertising performance.
        |-- campaign_insights  Analytics for Insights  — Provides analytics for reporting of campaign insights related to advertising and promotion activities.
        |-- content_performance  Analytics for Content Performance  — Analytics for reporting on content performance.
        `-- system  Analytics for System Activity  — Provides analytics for reporting on system activity.
            `-- performance  Analytics for System Performance  — Provides analytics for reporting on system performance.
